WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.090 --> 00:00:06.390
Assistant Researcher King prepared a ballpoint pen&nbsp;
and one note reading "“Nice to meet you SCP-914,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:06.390 --> 00:00:10.110
I am Assistant Researcher King, and&nbsp;
I hope we can work well together.”

00:00:10.110 --> 00:00:16.950
The output produced was a paper crown adorned with&nbsp;
drawn-on gems. When worn, a person is affected by&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:16.950 --> 00:00:23.010
a cognitohazard inducing hallucinations of being&nbsp;
the "king" of the area. Anyone who sees the paper&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:23.010 --> 00:00:28.530
crown upon the wearer's head directly, not through&nbsp;
a camera or other means, will also think that that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:28.530 --> 00:00:33.870
person is the ruler of the local area and will&nbsp;
follow given orders like a loyal subject would.

00:00:33.870 --> 00:00:38.790
It seems SCP-914 took King's&nbsp;
name rather literally.

